  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1189.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>As we know that&nbsp;if four points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;are coplanar, the vectors <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> must be coplanar.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo